r doctors.\nWhat is he doing?\nSelect one:\nA. highlighting the dangers of doing nothing.\nB. explaining when treatment may be required.\nC. suggesting that it can be difficult to make a diagnosis.", "sourcePage": 184, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "You hear an agency nurse checking his schedule with an employee at\nthe agency.\nWhen does the agency employee need the nurse to work?\nSelect one:\nA. on Saturday.\nB. on Monday.\nC. on Friday.", "sourcePage": 185, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 189, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "You hear a conversation between a senior nurse and a student nurse.\nThe senior nurse is\nSelect one:\nA. explaining a range of safety measures.\nB. highlighting how easily accidents can happen.\nC. outlining the use of some important hospital equipment.", "sourcePage": 185, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 189, "sou